AWS Cost Allocation – Excel Update SOP
Excel - Clear Old Values
•	Open the Excel file
•	Clear last month’s Bill Amount, Saving Plan Cost and Enterprise Support Cost
•	Clear values in Rows 12, 13, and 14 (all cost columns)
•	Fill cleared cells with 0 using Ctrl + Enter
•	Do not modify Total Cost cells
AWS - Cost Explorer – Get values for Total Cost
•	Set date range : eg December 1 to December 31 (Standard)
•	Group by: Dimension : Charge Type
•	Advanced options : Aggregate cost by: Net Amortized Cost
Excel – Fill Overall Costs
•	Copy Usage Cost and paste into Excel – Billing Amount  - H4
•	Copy Savings Plan Cost and paste into Excel - Savings Plan cost – H5
•	Enterprise Support cost to be updated later from Excel provided by EA
AWS & Excel – Get Product-wise EM Cost for On Demand (Row 12)
•	Group by: Dimension:  Tag → Product
•	Filter : More Filter : Charge Type : Exclude Enterprise Discount Program Discount and Savings Plan Covered Usage
•	Copy EM cost, paste to EM suite column Z12
•	DB-SERVER-1 to Database Instances on E2 – N12
•	RDS-SERVER-1 to Relational Database Service – R12
•	RDS-SERVER-2 to Relational Database Service – S12
•	FSX to FSX Volume 1, U12
•	Copy the common value to a notepad
•	Qlik replicate to K12
•	IPLUS to C12
•	Qlik compose to J12
•	Edifecs to H12
•	IPLUS API to B12
•	WPLUS(add in case of multiple entries) to D12
•	Note No-Tag values separately
AWS No-Tag Costs (Row 14)
•	Group by : Dimension :Service
•	Clear all filter
•	Filter Tag → Product → Include → No Tag key:Product
•	Paste RDS value in R14 (Relation Database Service)and CloudWatch to Y12
Common Services Calculation
•	Total Cost – RDS – CloudWatch + Common values which we copied earlier
•	Paste result into Common EC2 Services column W12
•	Validate Total Cost AB15 against Bill Amount H4 – Should be same
Get values for Compute Savings Row 13
•	Group by: Dimension :  Tag → Product
•	Clear all filter
•	Charge Type : Include Enterprise Discount and Savings Plan Covered Usage
•	Paste EM values into Row Z13
•	Paste IPLUS in C13
•	Qlik replicate in K13
•	Qlik Compose in J13
•	Edifecs in H13
•	IPLUS API in B13
•	WPLUS in D13
•	Validate total matches Savings Plan value ie AB 13 should be equal to H5
•	AB 15 should be equal to H7
Final Validation
•	G11 of summary sheet should match with H7 of Cost sheet
•	D11 of summary sheet should match with total of Service cost Across All Product Artifacts (I44 + I45 +I46 +I47)
•	E11 of summary sheet should match with total of Service cost Across All Custom Artifacts (I51+I52+I53+I54)
•	F11 of summary sheet should match with total of Cost of Services Across Shared Services (I58+I59+I60+I61+I62+I63+I64+I65+I66+I67+I68)
•	Update Enterprise Support from file send by EA





	
